<headline>IPO PRICING - Long Beach prices at $6.50.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Long Beach Financial Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At				     $6.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		     21,750,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter Friedman Billings Ramsey &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering was reduced to a target price of $6.50 from a range of $8 to $9. The original estimate for the initial public offering's price range was $10 to $12.</p>
